===

dotnet publish -c Release -o bin/Release/net10.0/publish
docker buildx build --no-cache --platform linux/amd64 -f Dockerfile.local -t longnguyen1331/hc-blazor:latest -t longnguyen1331/hc-blazor:latest . --push

Luu y:
- Script se xoa thu muc publish cu truoc khi `dotnet publish`.
- Blazor image duoc build truc tiep tu thu muc `src/HC.Blazor/bin/Release/net10.0/publish` (khong build tu context project root nua).
- API image build tu `src/HC.HttpApi.Host` voi `Dockerfile.local` (FROM hc-api-base:libreoffice-v1).
- **HC.BackgroundJobWorker**: `dotnet publish` vao `src/HC.BackgroundJobWorker/bin/Release/net10.0/publish`, sau do `docker buildx` voi `src/HC.BackgroundJobWorker/Dockerfile` (base `mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/runtime:10.0`, linux/amd64), push `longnguyen1331/hc-backgroundjobworker:<version>` va `:latest`.
- Nen dung tag version moi moi lan build (vi du: `latest-20260305-1`) thay vi chi dung `latest`.

# Chi build + push image BackgroundJobWorker (tay, neu can tach):
# cd /Users/nguyenlong/Documents/Projects/HCS/src/HC.BackgroundJobWorker
# dotnet publish -c Release -o bin/Release/net10.0/publish
# docker buildx build --pull --platform linux/amd64 -f Dockerfile -t longnguyen1331/hc-backgroundjobworker:YOUR_TAG -t longnguyen1331/hc-backgroundjobworker:latest . --push
